# CES-001 to CES-004 – log in with CIS2 (simulated) or an admin account,
# choose an organisation, log out

Start /sign-in
Scope /sign-in /signed-out /enrolments /catalogue /access-denied
Exclude /prototype /prototype-admin /assets
Tags log-in CES-001 CES-002 CES-003 CES-004

--- Setup ---

Goto /sign-in

--- Map ---

Visit /sign-in

# CIS2 route – user with two organisations
ClickLink "Log in with my Care Identity"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
Choose "Dr Asha Patel"
ClickButton "Continue"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
Choose "Riverside Community Health Services"
ClickButton "Continue"
Wait 1200
Snapshot

# Log out
ClickLink "Log out"
Wait 1200
Snapshot

# Admin route (Cognito)
Goto /sign-in
ClickLink "log in with an admin account"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
FillIn "Email address" with "lee.morgan@example.com"
Fill "#password" "password"
ClickButton "Log in"
Wait 1200
Snapshot

